; Optional KGB Clan War SQL statistics integration.
; v0.3.0 queries and the automatic public-v0.2.0 schema upgrade support the
; AMX Mod X MySQL/MariaDB SQLX driver. Other SQLX drivers are not supported.
; Disabled by default. Connection credentials are read from the standard
; addons/amxmodx/configs/sql.cfg managed by AMX Mod X; they do not belong here.
kgb_cw_sql_enabled 0
